+  <h1>ADC Reference Transfer Functions — Vocabulary</h1>
+  <p class="tagline">Eight terms behind the reference-aware ADC conversion. Each has a definition, a project example from the real code, a usage sentence, and a contrast with the term it's most often confused with.</p>
